client
dev tun
proto udp
remote [domain] 53
resolv-retry infinite
nobind
persist-key
persist-tun
machine-readable-output
connect-retry-max 5
connect-retry 5
resolv-retry 60
auth-user-pass
ns-cert-type server
comp-lzo
verb 3
